@page "/privacy"

<PageTitle>Privacy Policy | Spectrum Tattoo — Benton, TN</PageTitle>

<section class="section">
    <div class="container legal-prose">
        <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
        <h1 class="section-title" style="margin: 0.75rem 0 1.5rem;">Privacy <em>Policy</em></h1>
        <p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> November 18, 2026 &middot; <strong>Spectrum Tattoo</strong> (formerly The Old Crow Tattoo Parlor), 6165 US-411, Benton, TN 37307.</p>

        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>
            When you submit a consultation request, book an appointment, or contact Spectrum Tattoo by phone or online form, we may collect your name, phone number, email address, preferred artist, and design notes. At the studio, we also collect legally required age-verification and health/consent release information.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Payment Processing &amp; Financial Data</h2>
        <p>
            Spectrum Tattoo accepts major credit and debit cards and third-party payment processors (such as Square, Stripe, or PayPal). All electronic card transactions are encrypted and processed directly by PCI-DSS compliant third-party payment providers. We do not store full credit card numbers or CVV codes on our website servers.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Integrated Services, Forms &amp; Cookies</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Consultation &amp; Contact Forms:</strong> Used solely to respond to your tattoo, piercing, or permanent makeup inquiry and coordinate scheduling.</li>
            <li><strong>Transactional Communications:</strong> Appointment confirmations, deposit receipts, and aftercare follow-ups sent via email, phone, or SMS when requested.</li>
            <li><strong>Cookies &amp; Local Storage:</strong> Minimal browser storage may be used for progressive web app (PWA) offline caching and essential site functionality.</li>
            <li><strong>Social &amp; Map Links:</strong> External links (such as Facebook or map directions) are governed by those third-party platforms&rsquo; privacy policies.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. Your Rights &amp; Data Requests</h2>
        <p>
            You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your consultation contact information at any time by calling <a href="tel:+14232999111" style="color: var(--accent-gold);">(423) 299-9111</a> or visiting our studio at 6165 US-411, Benton, TN 37307.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>
